{"track":"python","category":"함수 만들기 ① 기본","level":1,"title":"직사각형 둘레","desc":"<p>가로 <code>w</code>, 세로 <code>h</code>인 직사각형의 <b>둘레</b>를 돌려주는 함수 <code>perimeter(w, h)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","starter":"def perimeter(w, h):\n    pass\n","solution":"def perimeter(w, h):\n    return 2 * (w + h)\n","hint":"<p>둘레 = 2 × (가로 + 세로)</p>","tests":[{"call":"perimeter(3, 4)","expected":14,"visible":true},{"call":"perimeter(1, 1)","expected":4,"visible":true},{"call":"perimeter(10, 0)","expected":20,"visible":false},{"call":"perimeter(2.5, 1.5)","expected":8,"visible":false}],"id":"py-281"}